Could you share your truthTable() command?
In particular, did you make use of the "incl.cut" argument? What inclusion (consistency) cut-off value did you use?

Also, the "outcome" is what you have in the data, while the truth table generated column is called "output" (to differentiate between the two).

I hope this helps,
Adrian

